    "effect": "Target: Your Pokémon\nEffect: While this Feature is Bound, whenever the Bound target hits a foe with an Electric Attack, they may choose to have the foe lose Hit Points equal to the target’s Tick value plus your Type-Linked Skill Rank. If this is done, the Bound target loses a Tick of Hit Points after the attack is resolved. While a Rain Weather Condition is active, the amount of HP the foe loses is doubled.\n\nThe additional hit point loss due to Short Circuit will still affect Ground-Type targets, even if they were immune to the initial attack.",
